    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/49bc6b807cc535867fd3e43e2df61325.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>One day, you are suddenly abducted to a completely white space. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/09f1ac6d8ac852ac563d888ac270b24c.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>In this place, with only a door and an elevator, gather offerings to sacrifice and survive for as long as possible. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/45ea0cbc2186349c6e23a96ed7a960c2.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>Except for you or others who were captured with you, no one else exists in this space, so if you see anyone, run away immediately.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/d5c7928277e675956f9e48adc9814820.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br> If you encounter danger or decide you have gathered enough offerings, don't hesitate to escape through the exit to return to safety.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/49bc6b807cc535867fd3e43e2df61325.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>One day, you are suddenly abducted to a completely white space. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/09f1ac6d8ac852ac563d888ac270b24c.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>In this place, with only a door and an elevator, gather offerings to sacrifice and survive for as long as possible. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/45ea0cbc2186349c6e23a96ed7a960c2.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br>Except for you or others who were captured with you, no one else exists in this space, so if you see anyone, run away immediately.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2997400/extras/d5c7928277e675956f9e48adc9814820.avif?t=1732100541\" width=600 height=374 /></span><br><br> If you encounter danger or decide you have gathered enough offerings, don't hesitate to escape through the exit to return to safety.",
